# Netlify production deploy (Forest Fest web)

After completing changes to `forest-fest-web/` that should be live, deploy to production unless the user explicitly says **not** to deploy.

## Default workflow

1. Run `npm run build` in `forest-fest-web/` to verify the build passes.
2. Deploy from `forest-fest-web/`:
   ```bash
   npx netlify deploy --prod --build
   ```
3. Confirm the production URL in the response: `https://forest-fest-2026.netlify.app`

## When to skip deploy

Only skip if the user clearly opts out, e.g. "don't deploy", "local only", or "no production deploy".

## Scope

- Applies to the web app in `forest-fest-web/`, not the native iOS app in `Forest Fest/`.
- Question-only or review-only tasks with no code changes do not need a deploy.
